1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
That small chip in your windshield?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
It's a clue that starts a clock.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Temperature swings and road vibration —

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
are what usually make it spread.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
A chip smaller than a quarter —

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
can often be repaired in under 30 minutes.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Once a crack reaches the edge of the glass —

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
that may indicate it's a replacement instead.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't guess how long it'll hold.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — stop by, we'll take a look, free. Link in bio.
